        <img class="story__detail" src="/images/landingpics/story-detail.png" alt="Close-up detail of hands at work" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="story__body">
        <p class="section-kicker">Behind the Counter</p>
        <h2>People, Not Just <em>Products</em></h2>
        <p>Làng &amp; Co. started as a notebook of names ~ the potter in Bát Tràng, the weaver in Vạn
          Phúc, the woodblock painter in Đông Hồ. We still list every piece with the workshop that made
          it, because a craft without a name is just an object.</p>
        <p>Today that notebook spans eight traditions ~ clay, silk, paint, incense, wood, water
          puppetry, bamboo, and stone, each with its own hands and its own patience.</p>
        <p>We visit before we list, pay before we ship, and publish the story alongside the price.
          It's slower. We think it's worth it.</p>
        <a class="text-cta" href="pages/blog/blog.html#post-developer-mission">Read Our Story <span>→</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

