    <!-- ================================================
         PROCESS — how a piece comes to life
         ================================================ -->
    <section class="process">
      <div class="process__media">
        <img src="/images/landingpics/process.png" alt="Kiln-firing ceramic pieces by hand" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="process__body">
        <p class="section-kicker">How It's Made</p>
        <h2>From Raw Material <em>to Ready</em></h2>
        <ol class="process__list">
          <li>
            <span class="process__num">01</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Sourced by Hand</h3>
              <p>Clay, silk cocoons, bamboo, timber, stone and natural pigments are gathered directly
                from trusted regional suppliers ~ no middlemen.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="process__num">02</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Shaped &amp; Formed</h3>
              <p>Every piece passes through an artisan's hands - thrown, woven, carved, painted, or
                bound, one at a time.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="process__num">03</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Finished with Patience</h3>
              <p>Glazing, dyeing, polishing or painting — the slowest stage, and the one that
                can't be rushed.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="process__num">04</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Packed &amp; Sent With Care</h3>
              <p>Wrapped by the same hands that made it, boxed, and shipped straight to your door.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

